flowchart TD
    START[Loop Hermes: squash PRs Dependabot] --> LIST[varre PRs abertos]
    LIST --> CHECK{mergeable?}
    CHECK -->|MERGEABLE| SQUASH[gh pr merge --squash]
    CHECK -->|CONFLICTING + dependabot/*| REBASE[comenta @dependabot rebase]
    CHECK -->|CONFLICTING + outro| SKIP[pula: nao invade branch alheio]
    SQUASH --> LOG[registra no log NUCLEO]
    REBASE --> WAIT[aguarda dependabot curar]
    WAIT --> LIST
    LOG --> WAIT2[sleep 60s]
    SKIP --> WAIT2
    WAIT2 --> LIST
    style START fill:#ffd700,stroke:#333
    style SQUASH fill:#51cf66,stroke:#333
    style REBASE fill:#4dabf7,stroke:#333
    style SKIP fill:#868e96,stroke:#333
